://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318889\n", "files": ["taskcluster/test_configs/variants.yml"], "git_node": "059396f779ae022a610e506b98cc4cc8a6361ada", "git_parents": ["99a2aef5ddf5d581aa9e8a9405721c7c30539070"], "node": "512e8d66c36cd1c06450193ee456a479629a1a0d", "parents": ["581131e55bdbdf7e9f4a3d7f34d08161f390cbf9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786815563, "git_changesets": ["99a2aef5ddf5d581aa9e8a9405721c7c30539070", "059396f779ae022a610e506b98cc4cc8a6361ada"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28014": {"changesets": [{"author": "Calixte Denizet \u003ccalixte.denizet@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058085 - Pick about:pdf files in the parent process.  a=RyanVM\n\nMove the file picker and PDF validation to AboutPDFParent so content never supplies a local path. Leave dropped PDFs to native drop handling.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318472\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318881\n", "files": ["toolkit/actors/AboutPDFChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/actors/AboutPDFParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/content/aboutPDF.html", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/content/aboutPDF.mjs", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/browser_aboutPDF.js", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/browser_aboutPDF_actor.js", "toolkit/components/aboutpdf/tests/browser/head.js", "toolkit/locales/en-US/toolkit/about/aboutPDF.ftl", "toolkit/modules/RemotePageAccessManager.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "3e10c8bce5e4ce872d42befaea31875d7cedfacc", "git_parents": ["059396f779ae022a610e506b98cc4cc8a6361ada"], "node": "5fde6e9a05121baec9dad8f44c700032de033d48", "parents": ["512e8d66c36cd1c06450193ee456a479629a1a0d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786815620, "git_changesets": ["3e10c8bce5e4ce872d42befaea31875d7cedfacc"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28015": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062099 - \"Add new container\" context menu option does not work from Library window or old sidebar  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317439\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318858\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/utilityOverlay.js", "browser/components/contextualidentity/content/ContainerCreationPanel.mjs", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_library_container_menu.js"], "git_node": "b84c380256a7d3a827f27a0e72aa8fac81c174cf", "git_parents": ["3e10c8bce5e4ce872d42befaea31875d7cedfacc"], "node": "901b2fb3b08bf12fdbfdd390ace6a21c568cd7b6", "parents": ["5fde6e9a05121baec9dad8f44c700032de033d48"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786815796, "git_changesets": ["b84c380256a7d3a827f27a0e72aa8fac81c174cf"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28016": {"changesets": [{"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063518 - Don't collapse the pinned tabs container when its contents can't be measured.  a=RyanVM\n\nupdatePinnedTabsHeightOnResize() clamped the persisted height to a\ngetBoundsWithoutFlushing() measurement of the items wrapper, so a measurement\ntaken before the tab strip has computed layout stuck a permanent height: 0px on\nthe container, leaving only a splitter or tab drag to recompute it. It also\napplied a height with horizontal tabs, which a height persisted for vertical\ntabs has no business sizing. SidebarState.updatePinnedTabsHeight() handles the\nhorizontal case, so defer to it.\n\nAn unmeasurable wrapper now leaves the container's height alone rather than\napplying the stored height unclamped, which reopens the gap bug 2042880 fixed --\nthe test here catches a 200px one.\n\ntest_pinned_tabs_height_reclamped_on_visibility_change asks for a launcher width\nits grid fits in, which the resizing tasks above it otherwise leave to where a\nsynthesized drag landed, and waits for that grid before measuring heights. The\nwait logs the layout it sees, since a strip that never becomes a grid otherwise\nreads as a clamping failure.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318747\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318827\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/SidebarState.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/browser-sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_resize_sidebar.js"], "git_node": "95165432e6d0a6f523dceefe18da17e3581b2975", "git_parents": ["b84c380256a7d3a827f27a0e72aa8fac81c174cf"], "node": "05be357979434e94d09e6a6609c72d3bd1f8bbea", "parents": ["901b2fb3b08bf12fdbfdd390ace6a21c568cd7b6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786815961, "git_changesets": ["95165432e6d0a6f523dceefe18da17e3581b2975"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28017": {"changesets": [{"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from main\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/browser/errorpages/src/main/res/values-lv/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/addons/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/app-links/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/ipprotection/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/prompts/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/protection-dashboard/src/main/res/values-be/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ab/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-am/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-an/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ar/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-ast/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-az/strin