dom depth from bloom filter.  a=RyanVM\n\nWe know the right depth, and the bloom filter doesn't get updated for\nstyles that don't need selector-matching, which made rule-node reuse\nless effective (since it was not necessarily looking at the right\ncache).\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318961\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319433\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/context.rs", "servo/components/style/driver.rs", "servo/components/style/gecko/traversal.rs", "servo/components/style/parallel.rs", "servo/components/style/sharing/mod.rs", "servo/components/style/style_resolver.rs", "servo/components/style/traversal.rs", "servo/ports/geckolib/glue.rs"], "git_node": "e6354d418d8c9804bb6c9784dde9814ad87b91f4", "git_parents": ["1a4ce26af0d068fcbfcfa43381563ff0b7d0c037"], "node": "8eb271f2e3596f989ab790a8bc8bbcb46a980f66", "parents": ["4bdbc0f53eba629b9bccb4cf2cee8ea39d1d2456"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787062108, "git_changesets": ["e6354d418d8c9804bb6c9784dde9814ad87b91f4"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28056": {"changesets": [{"author": "kpatenio \u003ckpatenio@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058570 \u2014 flush tab state for browser_should_restore_tab.js to address intermittent failures. r=sfoster, a=test-only DONTBUILD\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/test/browser_should_restore_tab.js"], "git_node": "7d8e5dce99bc59edab766dbee196d8378dee32e9", "git_parents": ["e6354d418d8c9804bb6c9784dde9814ad87b91f4"], "node": "404ee66e49718ed3a685c899d3b7d6ab4a0a367f", "parents": ["8eb271f2e3596f989ab790a8bc8bbcb46a980f66"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787075798, "git_changesets": ["7d8e5dce99bc59edab766dbee196d8378dee32e9"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28057": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andy Leiserson \u003caleiserson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059002.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318640\