https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317559\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320390\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/win/src/sandboxbroker/sandboxBroker.cpp"], "git_node": "9f9371ee5389c828451cf0ea4f86d563536e95ac", "git_parents": ["9cf29d2f48150fa5c78092f363fb119f71ce48b0"], "node": "bf850c87e0b9f18c9f530a724c7a68240d9dd401", "parents": ["71b9b34928af8d06a4b143f942b5be8723ea115f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058087 p2 - Block directory creation and only allow read access.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317560\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320391\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/patches/55_dont_broker_dir_creation_or_write.patch", "security/sandbox/chromium/sandbox/win/src/filesystem_dispatcher.cc"], "git_node": "8b1a4ce1225f41471e0df2ce64721eabb9ba236b", "git_parents": ["9f9371ee5389c828451cf0ea4f86d563536e95ac"], "node": "aa02ccd4c13de02e95c4dfeb27e702cb079d4c20", "parents": ["bf850c87e0b9f18c9f530a724c7a68240d9dd401"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787323393, "git_changesets": ["9f9371ee5389c828451cf0ea4f86d563536e95ac", "8b1a4ce1225f41471e0df2ce64721eabb9ba236b"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28140": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058101 - Use OpenKeyAction for RegistryDispatcher::NtCreateKey.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318175\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320425\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_dispatcher.cc", "security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_policy.cc", "security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_policy.h"], "git_node": "20d1c390fd956bb1c5af4417fe2c05fa2e0ccc58", "git_parents": ["8b1a4ce1225f41471e0df2ce64721eabb9ba236b"], "node": "e0f76236d138199b627423de9283d6835d48a207", "parents": ["aa02ccd4c13de02e95c4dfeb27e702cb079d4c20"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787323417, "git_changesets": ["20d1c390fd956bb1c5af4417fe2c05fa2e0ccc58"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28141": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan Grulich \u003cjgrulich@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059127 - WebRTC backport: Screen capture: validate and snapshot cursor and videocrop metadata  a=RyanVM\n\nCap cursor_meta-\u003esize against the negotiated maximum and validate that\nbitmap_offset and the bitmap pixel data offset both point within the\nmetadata region before forming pointers and copying data.\n\nCopy cursor and videocrop metadata headers from shared memory into\nlocal storage before validating and using their fields, so the\nproducer cannot modify them between validation and use.\n\nThis is a simple backport of an WebRTC upstream change.\n\nUpstream commit: 9b33b6c524a185a20586741af262370291000b69\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319761\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320339\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/linux/wayland/shared_screencast_stream.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/9b33b6c524.no-op-cherry-pick-msg"], "git_node": "399518fa61def71d285c2b6d4c6973e735250f84", "git_parents": ["20d1c390fd956bb1c5af4417fe2c05fa2e0ccc58"], "node": "fc8e5068c53845687e6c14e3cf9b00671f9bfa9c", "parents": ["e0f76236d138199b627423de9283d6835d48a207"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787323449, "git_changesets": ["399518fa61def71d285c2b6d4c6973e735250f84"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28142": {"changesets": [{"author": "Manuel Bucher \u003cmanuel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061799 - Derive storage access from WindowGlobalParent  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319576\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.co