cation fails, the already-allocated cell is left as a zombie struct with uninitialized inline reference fields. Zero the inline payload so obj_trace does not dereference garbage.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319584\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320461\n", "files": ["js/src/wasm/WasmGcObject-inl.h"], "git_node": "05660961935ff101c49448eb509c659367d97cad", "git_parents": ["99a939bbe07eb73dc437b58349a80b0b516561b6"], "node": "7b64eaaea96cdc52628241efe30ecba09c55c162", "parents": ["6e86590b921b8f6aa2fad18e8b1ae713bfc9a30a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787330055, "git_changesets": ["05660961935ff101c49448eb509c659367d97cad"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28149": {"changesets": [{"author": "Johannes Salas Schmidt \u003cjoschmidt@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065203 - Make the logins tests pass with the JSON storage backend (again)  a=RyanVM\n\nregressed by 2063993\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320175\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320377\n", "files": ["browser/components/migration/tests/marionette/test_refresh_firefox.py", "toolkit/components/passwordmgr/test/browser/browser_doorhanger_promptToChangePassword.js"], "git_node": "3b7250a99e8753b5227a45e382069c0883690b6c", "git_parents": ["05660961935ff101c49448eb509c659367d97cad"], "node": "ce629f378196f465b2f737db37adae235924b39f", "parents": ["7b64eaaea96cdc52628241efe30ecba09c55c162"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787342983, "git_changesets": ["3b7250a99e8753b5227a45e382069c0883690b6c"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28150": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sarah Clements \u003csclements@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063233 - Fix double line in account section of app menu  a=RyanVM\n\n* Update profiles divider, creating a new function to show and hide all relevant elements\n* Update styling and test coverage\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319480\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320361\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-profiles.js", "browser/base/content/browser-sync.js", "browser/base/content/test/sync/browser_sync.js", "browser/themes/shared/customizableui/panelUI-shared.css"], "git_node": "544ee946a62d8b3318904ebbd43348754360fd40", "git_parents": ["3b7250a99e8753b5227a45e382069c0883690b6c"], "node": "3741060f5837827e233929e5d25562b7038532b0", "parents": ["ce629f378196f465b2f737db37adae235924b39f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787343044, "git_changesets": ["544ee946a62d8b3318904ebbd43348754360fd40"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28151": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dimi \u003cdlee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065145 - Only enable the address autofill all-regions rollout on pre-release channels.  a=RyanVM\n\nBug 2035232 set extensions.formautofill.addresses.supported to \"on\" for\nall desktop channels, so address autofill became available in every\nregion rather than only on Nightly as that change intended.\n\nGate the pref on the update channel, mirroring the existing\nextensions.formautofill.useml gate: Nightly, Dev Edition and Beta keep\n\"on\", while Release and ESR fall back to \"detect\" and region-based\navailability.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320342\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320385\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/all.js"], "git_node": "42fdef93e04556e1b861d185b885e9140b64dc93", "git_parents": ["544ee946a62d8b3318904ebbd43348754360fd40"], "node": "5ca8bfcfd1fb0c45bcab5523191ce9abbe835de8", "parents": ["3741060f5837827e233929e5d25562b7038532b0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787343083, "git_changesets": ["42fdef93e04556e1b861d185b885e9140b64dc93"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28152": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061505.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316963\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320578\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.cpp"], "git_node": "0eb2ede550a17e04a2306de73f9e5af4379a976f", "git_parents": ["42fdef93e04556e1b861d185b885e9140b64dc93"], "node": "f8cd7327a0617b8df44cfef49895c92c28c21052", "parents": ["5ca8bfcfd1fb0c45bcab5523191ce9abbe835de8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787343208, "git_changesets": ["0eb2ede550a17e04a2306de73f9e5af4379a976f"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28153": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061495.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317641\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320576\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.cpp"], "git_node": "bf34d44e50dffc58c27fcb058077f4accde87b26", "git_parents": ["0eb2ede550a17e04a2306de73f9e5af4379a976f"], "node": "caa6d79208536ad9f81b146041ceaea347eeff7a", "parents": ["f8cd7327a0617b8df44cfef49895c92c28c21052"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787343243, "git_changesets": ["bf34d44e50dffc58c27fcb058077f4accde87b26"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28154": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update HSTS HPKP -  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320605\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": "f8b008623b437ff51facbea76d6c75d74264f984", "git_parents": ["bf34d44e50dffc58c27fcb058077f4accde87b26"], "node": "c9528b12e6ae3cd44c087983a68431c5fec50080", "parents": ["caa6d79208536ad9f81b146041ceaea347eeff7a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787349666, "git_changesets": ["f8b008623b437ff51facbea76d6c75d74264f984"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28155": {"changesets": [{"a