lla.com"}, "28209": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2063780 - Early return when session history should do nothing.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319133\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321153\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "e7dc33ae57a0c0cbce867c747b5ee4a97853cd48", "git_parents": ["77365f26cda876926fdc5b37265a95e62697ce4a"], "node": "8b6ed0e5a71ee09a2db88842f749e3048410a210", "parents": ["4bf71cade2538c3b2a7fd0ff14faf2c14d348dad"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2055028 - Don't perform unnecessary reload.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319134\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321154\n", "files": ["dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp"], "git_node": "2f8d6eaecd8bfcacdf088a718f888eb9c74f40d0", "git_parents": ["e7dc33ae57a0c0cbce867c747b5ee4a97853cd48"], "node": "2add80cbe1d3804108600073b233e643ba20d4af", "parents": ["8b6ed0e5a71ee09a2db88842f749e3048410a210"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787661123, "git_changesets": ["e7dc33ae57a0c0cbce867c747b5ee4a97853cd48", "2f8d6eaecd8bfcacdf088a718f888eb9c74f40d0"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28210": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michael Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065965 -  Tolerate quoted booleans and per-entry errors in policy validation.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320759\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321203\n", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_PolicySchemaValidator.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_extensionsettings.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_preferences.js", "toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/EnterprisePoliciesParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/enterprisepolicies/PolicySchemaValidator.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "3fa032273fe38a86bf3c9381d05002c8fec9d043", "git_parents": ["2f8d6eaecd8bfcacdf088a718f888eb9c74f40d0"], "node": "2532ced5a434c105b463af896e5626fde7d4c381", "parents": ["2add80cbe1d3804108600073b233e643ba20d4af"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787661219, "git_changesets": ["3fa032273fe38a86bf3c9381d05002c8fec9d043"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28211": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Rubino \u003cdrubino@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2065360 - Record which infobar button was clicked in messaging-system telemetry.  a=RyanVM\n\nInfobar button clicks report CLICK_PRIMARY_BUTTON or CLICK_SECONDARY_BUTTON,\nchosen by whether the clicked element carries the `primary` class, and the ping\nitself carries only message_id and event. When a message defines two buttons and\nneither sets `primary`, both clicks produce identical pings and the buttons\ncannot be distinguished in analysis.\n\nSpotlight already sends event_context.source, and\nAboutWelcomeTelemetry.submitGleanPingForPing echoes that key into the existing\nmessaging_system.event_source metric for every messaging-system ping regardless\nof surface, so no new Glean metric and no ping change are needed here.\n\nButton clicks now report event_context.source, using a new optional `id` on the\nbutton config and falling back to button_\u003cindex\u003e so existing messages gain the\ndistinction without recipe changes.\n\nThe DISMISSED event reports the originating event type, so the X button reports\ndismiss_button while a teardown the user did not ask for (a \"disconnected\"\nnotification, e.g. the tab or window closing) is no longer conflated with a\ndeliberate dismissal.\n\nMessagingExperiment.schema.json is regenerated from the template schemas with\nmake-schemas.py to pick up the new button `id` property.\n\nTest coverage:\n- browser_asrouter_infobar.js exercises a message with two non-primary buttons,\n  asserting the index fallback for one and an explicit `id` for the other, plus\n  cases for the dismiss-button and disconnected sources.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320313\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321055\n", "files": ["browser/components/asrouter/content-src/schemas/MessagingExperiment.schema.json", "browser/components/asrouter/content-src/templates/CFR/templates/InfoBar.schema.json", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/InfoBar.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/browser/browser_asrouter_infobar.js"], "git_node": "0497481ea99834ddac7ebb1e8f0d0e85aa81bbdf", "git_parents": ["3fa032273fe38a86bf3c9381d05002c8fec9d043"], "node": "9e9bfb20d8783a58135cb22e19723cc0b8c413c7", "parents": ["2532ced5a434c105b463af896e5626fde7d4c381"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787662781, "git_changesets": ["0497481ea99834ddac7ebb1e8f0d0e85aa81bbdf"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28212": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 8b532c2140db30c193436254a61ce964e7d2a121 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_154_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "d8daf0a4b4d2662e2d8f32c1cdc63cad4f1e135b", "git_parents": ["4fce20f036b0cf1fe3fad9ff62d5b7180727e14c"], "node": "11f05ea8aa531132d5494b0734c53e12e9211a1c", "parents": ["9c20d772368fae616c220c8c4309ca58924592dd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787663369, "git_changesets": ["d8daf0a4b4d2662e2d8f32c1cdc63cad4f1e135b"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28213": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 8b532c2140db30c193436254a61ce964e7d2a121 with FIREFOX_154_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "8bcca3a43f95463f107a5f9d868fe4be1b7b7ad0", "git_parents": ["d8daf0a4b4d2662e2d8f32c1cdc63c