or before design mode in HTMLEditor::IsStyleEditable.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320946\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321534\n", "files": ["editor/libeditor/HTMLEditor.cpp", "editor/libeditor/tests/mochitest.toml", "editor/libeditor/tests/test_plaintext_mail_in_design_mode.html"], "git_node": "1a32028be4c4a5468365e0860e17b88de82efa06", "git_parents": ["7f95f00e49b29011abe132e99a5eb0e978e912c3"], "node": "d282dbccf58555ad498b01e9d6348cd0b47f4ab7", "parents": ["dd96e56d710fa80ce81d248b0730a54e46596fe5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787762163, "git_changesets": ["1a32028be4c4a5468365e0860e17b88de82efa06"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28238": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2047643 - Add connection closer on port 8888 for test_session_resumption.js  a=RyanVM\n\nOn windows, the connection might not immediately fail with NS_ERROR_CONNECTION_REFUSED\nwhen there is nothing listeneing on the port. That seems to cause the test to go over the\n30 second limit.\n\nWe can fix this by increasing that limit (adding requesttimeoutfactor = 2 to the xpcshell.toml)\nor by adding a listener to port 8888 that immediately closes the connection.\nThat made the test go from 36 seconds to 12 seconds on my machine.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321508\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321571\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_session_resumption.js"], "git_node": "9b14788baacaf0bd1f63e71eace45be72e2aab89", "git_parents": ["1a32028be4c4a5468365e0860e17b88de82efa06"], "node": "b6001f8ea37c28b368294df75c35731c359daa90", "parents": ["d282dbccf58555ad498b01e9d6348cd0b47f4ab7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787762852, "git_changesets": ["9b14788baacaf0bd1f63e71eace45be72e2aab89"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28239": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066858 - Make the pref 'media.audio.reuse-stream-on-seek' only true by default on Nightly.  a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321579\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "ac1abc9c823989081c762ef7a77ac052491d74dd", "git_parents": ["9b14788baacaf0bd1f63e71eace45be72e2aab89"], "node": "25831ff1d4e1f7af7ef1282ba6a64bf51891f717", "parents": ["b6001f8ea37c28b368294df75c35731c359daa90"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787762925, "git_changesets": ["ac1abc9c823989081c762ef7a77ac052491d74dd"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "28240": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 92c5bf513a3e4e39fa70df2df6a565a1049a9920 with FIREFOX_153_2_0esr_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "ba9168741ea89dcb6c6d6ee3ce13cba9f654048c", "git_parents": ["635c3f34b0ebb225fd55da6f7db81afcc6105fd8"], "node": "a2e06f8517e34b9f557ad3aa363ec63e0cdf070b", "parents": ["1b1e257edcb400d803fd98f06c33806868fc512c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787763435, "git_changesets": ["ba9168741ea89dcb6c6d6ee3ce13cba9f654048c"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28241": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 1ace7e56a446a26f61ef013ac6967e8186f47704 with FIREFOX_140_15_0esr_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "7709e79925134e7c0ddcc5780846609a1dddfbf2", "git_parents": ["ba9168741ea89dcb6c6d6ee3ce13cba9f654048c"], "node": "918d42a97ad2cb622ac9ce81e246e92d9d44d94e", "parents": ["a2e06f8517e34b9f557ad3aa363ec63e0cdf070b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787763635, "git_changesets": ["7709e79925134e7c0ddcc5780846609a1dddfbf2"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28242": {"changesets": [{"author": "Arnaud Bienner \u003cabienner@mozilla.com\u0